3528   E409             ;*********************************************************
3529   E409             ;* Converts Packed Byte data into an Index in X and a
3530   E409             ;* bitpos in B
3531   E409             ;*
3532   E409             ;* Packed Data Format: IIII IBBB
3533   E409             ;*
3534   E409             ;*  Where IIIII is the index to the lamp buffers.
3535   E409             ;*    Values between 
3536   E409             ;*      0-7     lampbuffer0
3537   E409             ;*      7-15    
3538   E409             ;*********************************************************  
