4546   E9BB             ;***********************************************
4547   E9BB             ;* This routine is spawned as a thread when the
4548   E9BB             ;* credits in memory space do not match
4549   E9BB             ;* the number of credits in the CMOS RAM. It 
4550   E9BB             ;* Takes care of bringing them equal in a timely
4551   E9BB             ;* fashion and calling the game ROM hook each
4552   E9BB             ;* time a credit is added to the memory location. 
4553   E9BB             ;* With this, the game ROM can control the credit 
4554   E9BB             ;* award process.
4555   E9BB             ;***********************************************            
